{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/settings\/keyboardshortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines a keyboard shortcut for opening new scene windows."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"keyboardShortcut","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"key","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyEquivalent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13KeyEquivalentV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"modifiers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventModifiers","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI14EventModifiersV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EventModifiers"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .command, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"localization"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyboardShortcut","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV","text":"KeyboardShortcut"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyboardShortcut\/Localization-swift.struct","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV12LocalizationV","text":"Localization"},{"text":" = .automatic) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key equivalent the user presses to present the scene."}]}],"name":"key"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier keys required to perform the shortcut."}]}],"name":"modifiers"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The localization style to apply to the shortcut."}]}],"name":"localization"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that can be presented with a keyboard shortcut."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene’s keyboard shortcut is bound to the command it adds for creating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new windows (in the case of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"},{"type":"text","text":") or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bringing a singleton window forward (in the case of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"},{"type":"text","text":" and, on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Windows, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Settings"},{"type":"text","text":"). Pressing the keyboard shortcut is equivalent to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selecting the menu command."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where a command already has a keyboard shortcut, the scene’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type"